      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "37",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Thiec kua̱r kɛ luek kä I-ca-yaa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä min ci kuäär ni Ɣidh-ki-yaa jɛ liŋ, cuɛ bieynikɛ rɛ̈t kɛ jiath lɔaac, kä cuɛ la̱th ni bieyni cuali, kä cuɛ wä rɛy luaak Kuɔth Nhial. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ Ɛl-ya-kim ti̱i̱t dhɔaar kua̱r kɛnɛ Cɛb-na in la raan wec luɔ̱k, kɛ bööth palä tin di̱t ti ca rɔ̱ kum kɛ bieyni cuali jäk kä gök ni I-ca-yaa gat A-modh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ jɛ jiök i̱, “Ci Ɣidh-ki-yaa nɛmɛ lar, ni̱n ti̱ti̱ kɛ ni̱n ti jiäk, kɛ ni̱n bɛɛlä ti thil gɔy. Ce̱tkɛ kɛ ni̱n tin daapkɛ ni gaat, kä thilɛ buɔ̱m mi dapkɛ nikɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä dɔ̱ŋ bi Kuoth Nhial ni Kuothdu rieet Rɛ̈b-ca-kee diaal liŋ, min ci kuäär A-thi-ri-ya jɛ ja̱k kɛ ɣöö bɛ Kuoth in tëk ben kuëth, kä ci Kuoth Nhial ni Kuothdu kuëth ti̱ti̱ mal liŋ, kä bɛ nɛy tin latkɛ kɛ duäc. Kɛ kui̱c ɛmɔ pali kɛ kui̱ nɛɛni tin ci duɔth.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä min ci la̱a̱t kua̱r ni Ɣidh-ki-yaa ben kä I-ca-yaa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "cu I-ca-yaa kɛ jiök i̱, “La̱rɛ jɛ kuäärun ɛn ɣöö ci Kuoth Nhial wee i̱, ‘/Cu dual kɛ ruac in ci liŋ, min ci raan kɔar kua̱r A-thi-ri-ya jɛ lat kɛ kui̱dä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nɛnɛ, ɣän bä moc yiëë, bɛ thuk li̱eeŋ kä bɛ loc wi̱i̱dɛ. Kä bä jɛ jak kä li̱w kɛ ko̱r ni wi̱i̱dɛ.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Rɛ̈b-ca-kee rɔ ri̱t, kä cuɛ kuäär A-thi-ri-ya jek ko̱o̱r kɛ Lib-na, kɛ ɣöö cɛ liŋ ɛn ɣöö ci kuäär jiɛɛn kä La-kic. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci kuäär ruac liŋ kɛ kui̱ Tir-ɣa-kaa kuäär Kuc i̱, “Cɛ naath ti bi ben nyiëëny kɛ jɛ ja̱k.” Mëë cɛ jɛ liŋ, cuɛ naath jäk kä Ɣidh-ki-yaa wëë i̱, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“La̱tdɛ nɛmɛ Ɣidh-ki-yaa kuäär Juda i̱, ‘Ɛ Kuothdu /ci ji̱ kaŋ ɛn ɣöö /cɛ Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm bi ka̱m kuäär A-thi-ri-ya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nɛnɛ, ci mëë ci kua̱r A-thi-ri-ya jɛ lät kä mun kɛɛliw liŋ, ca jɛ da̱k ni piny. Kä ji̱n bi kään? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci kuth dööri kɛ met kän, döör tëë ci gua̱a̱ri kɛ däk, Go-dhan, kɛnɛ Ɣa-ran. Kɛ Rɛ-dhɛp, kɛ ji̱ E-dɛn tëë cieŋ kä Tɛ-lɛ̈-thar? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kuäär Ä-math kɛnɛ kuäär Ar-pad, kɛ kuäär wec Thɛ-par-wa-yim, kɛ kuäär Ɣenɛ̈ kiɛ kuäär Iwaa a nikä?’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Pal Ɣidh-ki-yaa kɛ Kuoth",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Ɣidh-ki-yaa warɛgak ka̱n tetni ja̱a̱kni, kä cuɛ jɛ kuɛn. Kä cuɛ wä rɛy luaak Kuɔth Nhial, kä cuɛ jɛ wä ɣär nhiam Kuɔth Nhial. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Ɣidh-ki-yaa pal nhiam Kuɔth Nhial wëë i̱, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aɣ, Kuoth Nhial in la Ruey Ɣɔaa ni Kuoth I-thɛ-rɛl, min te kɔm kuäärädɛ nhial wi̱i̱ pua̱nyni jaakni, ɛ ji̱n Kuoth ni kärɔa min ruaac kuäär wec muɔ̱ɔ̱n kɛɛliw. Kä ci nhial cak kɛnɛ piny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Päli ji̱thku piny lö Kuoth Nhial, kä li̱ŋni. Kä lɛp wäŋku lö Kuoth Nhial, kä gui̱cni. Kä liŋ ruac Thɛ̈n-ke-rib, min kuethɛ ni Kuoth in tëk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ thuɔ̱k lö Kuoth Nhial, kɛn kua̱r A-thi-ri-ya ca döör ti ŋuan däk kɛnɛ wi̱i̱kiɛn, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kä cikɛ kuthkiɛn yuɔr maac. Kɛ ɣöö thilɛ kɛ kuth, kɛ kuth ti la̱tkɛ kɛ tet nath, kɛ jiɛn kɛnɛ pääm. Kɛ kui̱c ɛmɔ cakɛ däk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä täämɛ lö Kuoth Nhial ni Kuothda, kän nɛy tetkädɛ, kä ba cu ŋa̱c ɛ wi̱c muɔ̱ɔ̱n kɛɛliw ɛn ɣöö ɛ ji̱n ni kärɔa la Kuoth Nhial ɔ.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jäkni I-ca-yaa kɛ ruac kä Kuäär",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu I-ca-yaa gat A-modh Ɣidh-ki-yaa jäk kä raan wëë i̱, “Ci Kuoth Nhial ni Kuoth I-thɛ-rɛl ruac, ɛn ɣöö cɛ palu liŋ kɛ kui̱ kua̱r A-thi-ri-ya ni Thɛ̈n-ke-rib. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nɛmɛ ɛ ruac in ci Kuoth Nhial ɛ lat kɛ kui̱dɛ, wëë i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kä nɛmɛ ba nyuuth kä ji̱. Ɛn waalɛ bi cam ni min ciɛk kä rɔa, kä kɛ ruɔ̱n in rɛwdɛ bi cam ni min ci duɔth thi̱n. Kä kɛ ruɔ̱n in diɔ̱ɔ̱kdiɛn bi pi̱eth, kä bi ŋɛɛr, kä pith ka̱a̱k wal kɛ kui̱ kɔaŋ kä cam dɛykiɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bi duɔth ji̱ dhɔaar Juda rɔ̱ yiath piny, kä bikɛ tekɛ kuay, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kɛ ɣöö kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm bɛ te duɔth ti bä thi̱n, kä bi buɔ̱n ben Pääm Dha-yɔn. Bi tiɛɛl nho̱kä Kuɔth Nhial in la Ruey Ɣɔaa ɛ la̱t.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
